<p>Identical hex confirms the same UTF-8 sequence went in through <code>addText()</code> and came back out
unchanged, not merely a string that happens to display the same way.
<a href="/build/embedded-fonts">Embedding Fonts</a> covers registering the font and checking its glyph
coverage before you draw with it.</p>
